He went dark.

518
00:20:48.334 --> 00:20:51.182
Eventually. I found out he
had joined bratva to survive.

519
00:20:51.206 --> 00:20:53.184
But his name hasn't popped up in years.

520
00:20:53.208 --> 00:20:54.992
I figured. you know. he had been killed

521
00:20:55.123 --> 00:20:57.430
with the trajectory he was on.

522
00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:01.366
Seems he got his stars instead.

523
00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:04.151
Well. his tenure as
boss will be short-lived.

524
00:21:04.175 --> 00:21:07.590
I want a full-scale raid
on his base of operations.

525
00:21:07.614 --> 00:21:09.200
We'll force his hand to give up the girl.

526
00:21:09.224 --> 00:21:12.290
Respectfully. obviously.
bratva is good for this.

527
00:21:12.314 --> 00:21:16.555
But with andrei. if they
sent him here from Moscow.

528
00:21:16.579 --> 00:21:19.297
he means something to the organization.

529
00:21:19.321 --> 00:21:21.212
and the powers that be are
watching. and he knows that.

530
00:21:21.236 --> 00:21:23.432
All the more reason for
him to make a statement.

531
00:21:23.456 --> 00:21:26.739
No one steals from bratva
on andrei ovechkin's watch.

532
00:21:26.763 --> 00:21:28.437
I don't know. my gut is just telling me

533
00:21:28.461 --> 00:21:30.656
that's not how he'd handle this.

534
00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:34.791
You know. it's sloppy. and
he's anything but sloppy.

535
00:21:34.815 --> 00:21:37.576
Jubal. an innocent girl's
life is on the line here.

536
00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:39.559
We've gotta have
more than just your gut.

537
00:21:41.996 --> 00:21:44.409
Are you sure you can be objective here?

538
00:21:44.433 --> 00:21:46.193
- Yeah. yeah. yeah.
- No. no. no.

539
00:21:46.217 --> 00:21:49.612
No. my historical knowledge
of andrei isn't a blind spot.

540
00:21:49.743 --> 00:21:52.243
If anything. it's an asset.

541
00:21:52.267 --> 00:21:54.506
Okay.

542
00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:57.185
How do you feel about
paying an old friend a visit?

543
00:22:08.805 --> 00:22:12.568
Hi. I'm here to speak with andrei.

544
00:22:12.592 --> 00:22:14.594
He's not taking visitors.

545
00:22:35.832 --> 00:22:38.487
That's not how we treat
our friends. is it. mitya?

546
00:22:44.319 --> 00:22:45.842
Jubal Valentine.

547
00:22:45.973 --> 00:22:47.888
All right.

548
00:22:48.018 --> 00:22:51.674
Or I should say. assistant
special agent in charge?

549
00:22:51.805 --> 00:22:53.957
- Okay. Yeah.
- So you looked me up.

550
00:22:53.981 --> 00:22:57.656
I... I'd be surprised if you
had recognized me that fast.

551
00:22:57.680 --> 00:23:00.398
Your Russian accent is also memorable.

552
00:23:00.422 --> 00:23:01.834
Okay.

553
00:23:01.858 --> 00:23:03.096
Come.

554
00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:03.880
We have much to discuss.

555
00:23:03.904 --> 00:23:05.427
Yeah.

556
00:23:07.081 --> 00:23:08.841
No clothes. no weapons. no wires.

557
00:23:08.865 --> 00:23:09.985
If I didn't know any better.

558
00:23:10.040 --> 00:23:11.453
I'd say you don't trust me. andrei.

559
00:23:11.477 --> 00:23:15.326
The boy I knew.

560
00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:19.417
the one who referred to
the rules as suggestions.

561
00:23:19.441 --> 00:23:23.967
him. I trusted with my life.

562
00:23:24.098 --> 00:23:25.467
You disappeared on me. man.

563
00:23:26.622 --> 00:23:28.885
What happened. right?

564
00:23:29.016 --> 00:23:33.257
Jubal. please.

565
00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:38.678
I'm not so naive to
think this is a social call.

566
00:23:39.635 --> 00:23:41.550
Yeah. Well. you're right.

567
00:23:41.681 --> 00:23:43.963
Did your men abduct a 15-year-old girl

568
00:23:43.987 --> 00:23:45.530
named faith Williams yesterday?

569
00:23:45.554 --> 00:23:47.576
We did not.

570
00:23:47.600 --> 00:23:50.994
I know about the stolen crypto wallet

571
00:23:51.125 --> 00:23:53.495
that belonged to the bratva front.

572
00:23:53.519 --> 00:23:56.149
And you guys have
no sympathy for thieves.

573
00:23:56.173 --> 00:24:02.092
So I am speaking to
the FBI. not my old friend.

574
00:24:04.138 --> 00:24:06.053
We both made choices.

575
00:24:09.709 --> 00:24:12.581
Yeah. we were out some Bitcoin.

576
00:24:12.712 --> 00:24:14.951
but I don't play games for small prices.

577
00:24:14.975 --> 00:24:16.779
315k. that's not nothing.

578
00:24:16.803 --> 00:24:19.172
To us? Please.

579
00:24:19.196 --> 00:24:22.175
And look at the trouble
it's caused between the FBI.

580
00:24:22.199 --> 00:24:23.481
the online exposure.

581
00:24:23.505 --> 00:24:24.613
Online exposure?

582
00:24:24.637 --> 00:24:28.007
Bratva's shame is now public.

583
00:24:28.031 --> 00:24:30.575
Everyone know that boy stole from us.

584
00:24:30.599 --> 00:24:33.143
His name. his address. the amount...

585
00:24:33.167 --> 00:24:35.212
it's all posted online.

586
00:24:35.343 --> 00:24:36.866
So this kid made a fool of you.

587
00:24:36.997 --> 00:24:39.062
and you knew exactly who he
was and where you could find him.

588
00:24:39.086 --> 00:24:43.109
Jubal. anyone knows how
much cash that boy is sitting on.

589
00:24:43.133 --> 00:24:46.049
Why would I do that?

590
00:24:46.180 --> 00:24:49.183
I knew it's gonna be
open season on the boy.

591
00:24:51.707 --> 00:24:53.685
Andrei was telling you the truth.

592
00:24:53.709 --> 00:24:55.557
The forum is called protect the block.

593
00:24:55.581 --> 00:24:57.844
referring to the block chain.

594
00:24:57.974 --> 00:24:59.082
So Lucas Williams was
doxxed on this forum.

595
00:24:59.106 --> 00:25:00.716
He was.

596
00:25:00.847 --> 00:25:02.738
The site tracks suspicious
crypto transactions...

597
00:25:02.762 --> 00:25:06.132
anonymously. but I am
working on ID'ing them.

598
00:25:06.156 --> 00:25:08.289
And cyber crimes had
no idea about this forum?

599
00:25:08.419 --> 00:25:10.073
We don't have the manpower.

600
00:25:10.204 --> 00:25:13.076
Crypto theft is the
wild west of cybercrime.

601
00:25:13.207 --> 00:25:14.706
Fitting 'cause whoever runs this forum

602
00:25:14.730 --> 00:25:16.491
claims to be a white hat hacker.

603
00:25:16.515 --> 00:25:20.016
But this hacker. he.
what. deputized himself?

604
00:25:20.040 --> 00:25:21.824
He thinks they're on the side of justice.

605
00:25:21.955 --> 00:25:24.063
Yes. if they suspect
someone has stolen Bitcoin

606
00:25:24.087 --> 00:25:26.631
from another wallet.
they expose the thief.

607
00:25:26.655 --> 00:25:29.919
Tagline of the forum is.
"actions have consequences."

608
00:25:30.050 --> 00:25:32.661
Right. a-and they flagged
Lucas Williams's scam.

609
00:25:32.792 --> 00:25:35.248
posted his address. photos. all that.

610
00:25:35.272 --> 00:25:36.796
And the exact amount that he stole.

611
00:25:36.926 --> 00:25:38.469
Okay.

612
00:25:38.493 --> 00:25:40.993
Well. that's an "x marks the spot"

613
00:25:41.017 --> 00:25:44.040
for any criminal who wants to
grab 315.000 in stolen crypto.

614
00:25:44.064 --> 00:25:46.144
And anyone with an
Internet connection can see it.

615
00:25:46.196 --> 00:25:47.522
I guess that's what andrei meant

616
00:25:47.546 --> 00:25:50.046
when he said it's open season.

617
00:25:50.070 --> 00:25:51.898
I just unmasked our white hat...

618
00:25:52.028 --> 00:25:55.312
Whitney kabialis. software
developer here in the city.

619
00:25:55.336 --> 00:25:57.270
She might know more.

620
00:26:00.820 --> 00:26:02.319
I did nothing wrong.

621
00:26:02.343 --> 00:26:04.669
Doxxing isn't even a crime.

622
00:26:04.693 --> 00:26:06.105
That kid stole the money.

623
00:26:06.129 --> 00:26:07.759
I just caught him before you did.

624
00:26:07.783 --> 00:26:09.848
No. Whitney. what you did

625
00:26:09.872 --> 00:26:11.894
was set off a chain of criminal events

626
00:26:11.918 --> 00:26:15.791
that led to two people being murdered.

627
00:26:15.922 --> 00:26:18.577
including the abduction
of an innocent girl.

628
00:26:19.969 --> 00:26:22.102
Faith Williams is 15.

629
00:26:22.232 --> 00:26:23.645
She had nothing to do with this.

630
00:26:23.669 --> 00:26:25.516
and now her life is being ransomed

631
00:26:25.540 --> 00:26:28.693
for some stolen Bitcoin.
all thanks to your forum.

632
00:26:28.717 --> 00:26:31.348
I hope you find the girl. I really do.

633
00:26:31.372 --> 00:26:34.046
But I am not responsible for
what nutjobs do with my posts.

634
00:26:34.070 --> 00:26:36.483
Legally. that is not true.

635
00:26:36.507 --> 00:26:38.877
You will be charged
with accessory to murder.

636
00:26:38.901 --> 00:26:41.663
kidnapping. endangerment of a minor.

637
00:26:41.687 --> 00:26:44.317
What is it that you always say?

638
00:26:44.341 --> 00:26:46.015
"Actions have consequences"?

639
00:26:48.824 --> 00:26:51.107
- Now a good time?
- It's perfect.

640
00:26:51.131 --> 00:26:52.456
Whitney here was just about to offer

641
00:26:52.480 --> 00:26:54.458
her full cooperation. right?

642
00:26:54.482 --> 00:26:57.200
Yeah. I'll help.

643
00:26:57.224 --> 00:26:58.680
Terrific.

644
00:26:58.704 --> 00:27:02.597
Meet FBI intelligence analyst Ian lim.

645
00:27:02.621 --> 00:27:05.406
He's the one who
cracked your forum security

646
00:27:05.536 --> 00:27:08.037
- and identified you.
- Shadow proxy?

647
00:27:08.061 --> 00:27:10.343
Been trying to narrow down
who might have seen your post

648
00:27:10.367 --> 00:27:12.345
with Lucas Williams' information.

649
00:27:12.369 --> 00:27:14.478
but your site wipes all
incoming ip addresses.

650
00:27:14.502 --> 00:27:17.829
- Yeah. volatile logging.
- There is no backup.

651
00:27:17.853 --> 00:27:19.918
You must have the
kidnappers' wallet address. right?

652
00:27:19.942 --> 00:27:21.572
Yes. it was included in the ransom.

653
00:27:21.596 --> 00:27:24.662
You should be able to ID them
from the previous transactions.

654
00:27:24.686 --> 00:27:27.273
New wallet. never been used.

655
00:27:27.297 --> 00:27:28.734
So they know what they're doing.

656
00:27:28.864 --> 00:27:30.450
What haven't I tried?

657
00:27:30.474 --> 00:27:32.912
We have no other way to track
or even communicate with them.

658
00:27:35.697 --> 00:27:37.133
This girl's life depends on it.

659
00:27:40.833 --> 00:27:42.114
Sending crypto is the only real way

660
00:27:42.138 --> 00:27:43.768
to elicit wallet activity.

661
00:27:43.792 --> 00:27:46.815
Wait. I... sorry. I'm
trying to keep up here.

662
00:27:46.839 --> 00:27:48.555
It sounds like you're saying the only way

663
00:27:48.579 --> 00:27:50.819
to trace back to the kidnappers

664
00:27:50.843 --> 00:27:53.236
is to actually send the Bitcoin.

665
00:27:53.367 --> 00:27:58.261
Unless... We drop
something else in their wallet.

666
00:28:02.855 --> 00:28:04.789
All right. I know I'm still
out here carrying cash.

667
00:28:04.813 --> 00:28:06.617
but I think I understand
enough about crypto

668
00:28:06.641 --> 00:28:09.751
to know you can't send a
text to a wallet address. right?

669
00:28:09.775 --> 00:28:11.709
Correct. You can only send crypto.

670
00:28:11.733 --> 00:28:14.799
But I can create a new digital coin

671
00:28:14.823 --> 00:28:16.540
that we can send to
the kidnappers' wallet.

672
00:28:16.564 --> 00:28:19.262
What. you can just create
a new cryptocurrency?

673
00:28:19.393 --> 00:28:21.110
Anyone can. It takes five minutes.

674
00:28:21.134 --> 00:28:22.654
You're out here printing money. bro.

675
00:28:22.744 --> 00:28:23.895
Yeah. not really.

676
00:28:23.919 --> 00:28:26.071
It'll be valueless.

677
00:28:26.095 --> 00:28:30.423
Just need it to get the
kidnappers' attention.

678
00:28:30.447 --> 00:28:35.037
May I present... "Proof of life first" coin.

679
00:28:35.061 --> 00:28:36.255
Very smart.

680
00:28:36.279 --> 00:28:37.866
The coin is the message.

681
00:28:37.890 --> 00:28:40.129
and hopefully this will get
them to turn on their burner.

682
00:28:40.153 --> 00:28:41.720
Exactly.

683
00:28:41.850 --> 00:28:44.133
As soon as this coin appears
in the kidnappers' wallet.

684
00:28:44.157 --> 00:28:46.309
it'll tell them that Lucas is only willing

685
00:28:46.333 --> 00:28:48.528
to pay the ransom if
they prove that his sister

686
00:28:48.552 --> 00:28:50.076
is still alive.

687
00:28:50.206 --> 00:28:52.034
They turn on their burner to send proof.

688
00:28:52.165 --> 00:28:53.732
So send it.

689
00:28:59.607 --> 00:29:00.932
Kidnappers must have
seen Ian's "proof of life" coin

690
00:29:00.956 --> 00:29:02.281
and turned their burners back on.

691
00:29:02.305 --> 00:29:03.543
Just in time.

692
00:29:03.567 --> 00:29:04.588
It looks like they are about to respond.

693
00:29:04.612 --> 00:29:06.503
Okay. here we go.

694
00:29:06.527 --> 00:29:08.244
Lucas. please give them the money.

695
00:29:08.268 --> 00:29:09.811
They said they're gonna kill me

696
00:29:09.835 --> 00:29:10.986
if you don't give them the money.

697
00:29:11.010 --> 00:29:12.378
Okay. time stamp on that news clip

698
00:29:12.402 --> 00:29:13.379
is from one minute ago.

699
00:29:13.403 --> 00:29:14.883
Turn that station on.

700
00:29:17.103 --> 00:29:19.168
Is that... yeah.

701
00:29:19.192 --> 00:29:21.474
Yeah. that's live. We
can still save this girl.

702
00:29:21.498 --> 00:29:23.389
Okay. so where are they holding her?

703
00:29:23.413 --> 00:29:26.305
The burner that they're using
doesn't have GPS services on.

704
00:29:26.329 --> 00:29:29.115
and they stripped all location
metadata from the video.

705
00:29:29.245 --> 00:29:31.180
She's in a pretty nondescript room.

706
00:29:31.204 --> 00:29:32.355
Hang on.

707
00:29:32.379 --> 00:29:38.143
That structure is a
round masonry heater.

708
00:29:38.167 --> 00:29:39.492
That kind of brick design
with a small firebox.

709
00:29:39.516 --> 00:29:40.842
that's really unusual.

710
00:29:40.866 --> 00:29:44.783
It's German style. circa 1900 to 1915.

711
00:29:44.913 --> 00:29:47.152
You're up on 20th century
masonry now. moran?

712
00:29:47.176 --> 00:29:48.632
I helped my uncle renovate
a building one summer.

713
00:29:48.656 --> 00:29:50.155
Would you let the man cook?

714
00:29:50.179 --> 00:29:52.312
Most owners ripped these out by the '90s

715
00:29:52.442 --> 00:29:55.073
because of the city's updated
air pollution control code.

716
00:29:55.097 --> 00:29:57.641
but the ones that didn't
need to file permits.

717
00:29:57.665 --> 00:29:59.295
- Elise.
- Yeah.

718
00:29:59.319 --> 00:30:01.234
There can't be many of those things left.

719
00:30:01.364 --> 00:30:04.779
Searching department of
buildings records for section...

720
00:30:04.803 --> 00:30:06.302
- 21.
- 21 masonry permits.

721
00:30:06.326 --> 00:30:10.156
filtering by year and style.

722
00:30:10.286 --> 00:30:11.524
Okay. And then there were four left.

723
00:30:11.548 --> 00:30:12.787
Yeah. we'll split the team.

724
00:30:12.811 --> 00:30:14.508
We'll narrow it down on the ground.

725
00:30:21.732 --> 00:30:24.213
Okay. SWAT's still a few minutes out.

726
00:30:24.344 --> 00:30:26.496
Maggie and oa cleared
the other two buildings.

727
00:30:26.520 --> 00:30:28.759
So you've got a 50/50 shot with this one.

728
00:30:28.783 --> 00:30:30.108
Just proceed with caution.

729
00:30:36.051 --> 00:30:38.421
We're in the right place.

730
00:30:38.445 --> 00:30:40.292
Confirmed. jubal. this is
where faith was being held.

731
00:30:40.316 --> 00:30:42.555
Copy that.

732
00:30:44.059 --> 00:30:46.105
It's almost time. We gotta go.

733
00:30:51.066 --> 00:30:53.175
All right. I count two... armed.

734
00:30:53.199 --> 00:30:54.916
- Any eyes on faith?
- Negative.

735
00:30:54.940 --> 00:30:57.701
We gotta confirm that faith is on site.

736
00:30:57.725 --> 00:30:59.118
Copy. Going right.

737
00:31:08.562 --> 00:31:09.931
Go. go. go.

738
00:31:14.611 --> 00:31:16.676
- Got him?
- Go!

739
00:31:41.421 --> 00:31:44.052
Opcen. two male suspects
fleeing north on dupont.

740
00:31:44.076 --> 00:31:46.402
black dodge challenger.
Couldn't get a plate.

741
00:31:46.426 --> 00:31:48.534
Put out a bolo now.

742
00:31:48.558 --> 00:31:50.430
So... so two kidnappers got away.

743
00:31:50.560 --> 00:31:51.692
One was killed.

744
00:31:51.822 --> 00:31:53.061
What about Lucas Williams's sister?

745
00:31:53.085 --> 00:31:54.149
No. Eva and scola swept the property.

746
00:31:54.173 --> 00:31:55.217
She was not there.

747
00:31:55.348 --> 00:31:56.586
So we don't know if she's alive or dead.

748
00:31:56.610 --> 00:31:57.761
No. but we're digging into the perp

749
00:31:57.785 --> 00:31:58.893
that our team took down.
How we doing. Elise?

750
00:31:58.917 --> 00:32:01.199
Yep. Simon brumel. 20 years old.

751
00:32:01.223 --> 00:32:03.898
No gang affiliation. just
minor drug possession.

752
00:32:03.922 --> 00:32:05.682
assault charges for a couple bar fights.

753
00:32:05.706 --> 00:32:07.292
It's a big leap from drunk and disorderly

754
00:32:07.316 --> 00:32:09.468
- to murder and kidnapping.
- Got something.

755
00:32:09.492 --> 00:32:14.410
Simon wasn't affiliated.
but looks like his father was.

756
00:32:15.716 --> 00:32:17.065
He's bratva?

757
00:32:23.637 --> 00:32:24.744
Why are you sweating. man?

758
00:32:24.768 --> 00:32:26.205
We'll be there.

759
00:32:28.511 --> 00:32:31.316
- You lied to me.
- Go to another room.

760
00:32:31.340 --> 00:32:34.145
Faith Williams' kidnappers.
they... they work for you.

761
00:32:34.169 --> 00:32:35.842
You really thought I
wouldn't figure it out?

762
00:32:35.866 --> 00:32:36.843
You're not that slick.

763
00:32:36.867 --> 00:32:38.236
Do not mistake our history

764
00:32:38.260 --> 00:32:40.480
for permission to disrespect me.

765
00:32:40.610 --> 00:32:42.699
I'm starting to question
our history altogether.

766
00:32:42.830 --> 00:32:44.634
What are you doing.
man? She is a child.

767
00:32:44.658 --> 00:32:46.312
I did not order this.

768
00:32:46.442 --> 00:32:48.464
No? We ID'd one of the kidnappers.

769
00:32:48.488 --> 00:32:50.881
The name brumel ring any bells?

770
00:32:51.012 --> 00:32:53.034
Brumel's boy does not work for me.

771
00:32:53.058 --> 00:32:54.842
None of those kids do.

772
00:32:54.973 --> 00:32:57.690
I heard whispers about these kids.

773
00:32:57.714 --> 00:33:01.259
they're trying to make a
reputation. to get noticed.

774
00:33:01.283 --> 00:33:05.655
Well. they did. just not
so much how they hoped.

775
00:33:05.679 --> 00:33:09.204
And I found out only
after you came here.

776
00:33:10.553 --> 00:33:12.836
I don't know where
they're holding the girl.

777
00:33:14.427 --> 00:33:16.516
Prove it.

778
00:33:16.646 --> 00:33:17.797
Help me save her.

779
00:33:30.443 --> 00:33:31.443
Thank you.

780
00:33:33.837 --> 00:33:36.425
Thank you. Robin.

781
00:33:36.449 --> 00:33:38.383
You want some?

782
00:33:38.407 --> 00:33:41.430
Still eating like a 14-year-old. I see.

783
00:33:41.454 --> 00:33:44.433
Old habits. I know.

784
00:33:44.457 --> 00:33:46.261
It'll be the death of me.

785
00:33:49.984 --> 00:33:53.746
Trust. jubal.

786
00:33:53.770 --> 00:33:55.966
I asked these kids to meet.

787
00:33:55.990 --> 00:33:57.165
They'll come to me.

788
00:33:59.341 --> 00:34:01.822
Andrei's intel helped
us identify these two men

789
00:34:01.952 --> 00:34:06.411
as our kidnappers... nikita
kharkov and ilia marinov.

790
00:34:06.435 --> 00:34:08.065
They're practically kids.

791
00:34:08.089 --> 00:34:10.762
If they spook and they don't
show up. we have nothing.

792
00:34:10.786 --> 00:34:12.809
Having a face-to-face with
andrei means something.

793
00:34:12.833 --> 00:34:14.070
If they're trying to move
up. this is their chance

794
00:34:14.094 --> 00:34:16.073
to impress the boss.

795
00:34:16.097 --> 00:34:17.596
They think recovering andrei's 300k

796
00:34:17.620 --> 00:34:19.858
will make them invaluable to bratva.

797
00:34:19.882 --> 00:34:21.599
Okay. jubal's wire is hot.

798
00:34:21.623 --> 00:34:24.081
He and andrei are gonna get
them to incriminate themselves.

799
00:34:24.105 --> 00:34:26.083
then we will arrest them
and use that information

800
00:34:26.107 --> 00:34:28.259
to see if we can get
faith Williams' location.

801
00:34:28.283 --> 00:34:29.913
Andrei could have
something planned here.

802
00:34:29.937 --> 00:34:31.460
Are we sure we trust him?

803
00:34:31.591 --> 00:34:32.591
No.

804
00:34:34.507 --> 00:34:36.117
Showtime.

805
00:34:36.248 --> 00:34:37.945
Hey. jubal. we have a car pulling up now.

806
00:34:38.076 --> 00:34:40.619
Is it the black dodge we
last saw the suspects driving?

807
00:34:40.643 --> 00:34:43.342
No. it's a green BMW.

808
00:34:45.518 --> 00:34:46.735
Okay. we got a problem.

809
00:34:46.867 --> 00:34:49.498
Nikita's the only one that showed up.

810
00:34:49.522 --> 00:34:50.934
That means that ilia might be with faith

811
00:34:50.958 --> 00:34:52.457
at a different location.

812
00:34:52.481 --> 00:34:53.849
I think it's gonna put her in danger

813
00:34:53.873 --> 00:34:55.155
if we arrest nikita here.

814
00:34:55.179 --> 00:34:56.920
What I think you should do is get nikita

815
00:34:57.051 --> 00:34:58.507
to say the location
where they're holding faith.

816
00:34:58.531 --> 00:35:00.707
And whatever you do.
make sure that nikita

817
00:35:00.837 --> 00:35:02.100
and ilia don't speak.

818
00:35:05.146 --> 00:35:06.036
Here he comes.

819
00:35:06.060 --> 00:35:08.454
Da. Da.

820
00:35:16.853 --> 00:35:18.831
You wanted my attention.

821
00:35:18.855 --> 00:35:20.030
You have it.

822
00:35:36.873 --> 00:35:38.938
We figured out who robbed you.

823
00:35:38.962 --> 00:35:41.854
Did I ask you to do that?

824
00:35:41.878 --> 00:35:43.532
Do I know you at all?

825
00:35:43.663 --> 00:35:44.881
No.

826
00:35:47.710 --> 00:35:50.515
But I know you.

827
00:35:50.539 --> 00:35:51.864
I could be an asset to you.

828
00:35:51.888 --> 00:35:54.737
Make sure no one steals
from you ever again.

829
00:35:54.761 --> 00:35:56.110
So where's my money?

830
00:35:58.765 --> 00:36:04.877
I'll have it in... 90 seconds.

831
00:36:04.901 --> 00:36:06.705
How... how much?

832
00:36:06.729 --> 00:36:08.601
All of it.

833
00:36:08.731 --> 00:36:11.928
315.000 in Bitcoin.

834
00:36:11.952 --> 00:36:14.713
Is it me. or are you also
feeling a little doubtful here?

835
00:36:14.737 --> 00:36:16.672
I mean. why is this...
why is he so confident

836
00:36:16.696 --> 00:36:18.393
that the money's gonna come through?

837
00:36:22.745 --> 00:36:24.332
I'm the accountant. Okay?

838
00:36:24.356 --> 00:36:28.186
He is part of bratva. unlike you.

839
00:36:28.316 --> 00:36:30.231
Answer his question.

840
00:36:31.972 --> 00:36:35.367
We're not stupid. okay?

841
00:36:35.497 --> 00:36:37.586
We have the sister as collateral.

842
00:36:37.717 --> 00:36:40.217
You don't get your money
by 5:00 P.M.. we kill her.

843
00:36:40.241 --> 00:36:43.810
Okay. well. I hate to break
it to you. but it's 5:00 P.M..

844
00:36:43.940 --> 00:36:45.594
so where is it?

845
00:36:45.725 --> 00:36:46.745
I see no money.

846
00:36:53.820 --> 00:36:56.388
We'll show the thief we're serious.

847
00:36:56.518 --> 00:36:58.235
- Ilia will finish the job.
- No. no. no.

848
00:36:58.259 --> 00:37:00.368
No. no. stop. stop. stop. stop.

849
00:37:00.392 --> 00:37:02.152
You kill that girl. my boss doesn't

850
00:37:02.176 --> 00:37:03.371
get his money. all right?

851
00:37:03.395 --> 00:37:05.005
You need to tell us where she is.

852
00:37:06.876 --> 00:37:08.506
Hey. I said stop.

853
00:37:08.530 --> 00:37:09.768
You need to tell us
where the girl is right now.

854
00:37:09.792 --> 00:37:12.249
Let go of me! I can handle this. okay?

855
00:37:12.273 --> 00:37:14.251
Enough.

856
00:37:14.275 --> 00:37:16.819
Tell me where the girl
is before your stupidity

857
00:37:16.843 --> 00:37:18.821
brings us all down.

858
00:37:18.845 --> 00:37:21.500
The real men will clean up your mess.

859
00:37:23.458 --> 00:37:27.114
You're gonna wanna check
how you talk to me. old man.

860
00:37:27.245 --> 00:37:28.526
I'll be running bratva one day.

861
00:37:28.550 --> 00:37:34.687
Kid... You will never be
a part of my organization.

862
00:37:38.778 --> 00:37:39.778
Damn it.

863
00:37:45.306 --> 00:37:47.241
Let me see. Let me see.

864
00:37:47.265 --> 00:37:49.417
We need a medic in here!

865
00:37:49.441 --> 00:37:51.593
- It's over. nikita.
- Get off me!

866
00:37:51.617 --> 00:37:52.942
Where is faith Williams?

867
00:37:54.707 --> 00:37:57.207
You better pray that that girl is still alive.

868
00:37:57.231 --> 00:38:00.123
Where is she. nikita? Tell me!

869
00:38:00.147 --> 00:38:02.908
Maggie. ilia is two blocks
north in the dodge challenger.

870
00:38:02.932 --> 00:38:04.083
He has faith.

871
00:38:04.107 --> 00:38:05.824
Copy. We're on our way.

872
00:38:09.852 --> 00:38:11.003
Don't shoot.

873
00:38:11.027 --> 00:38:12.115
She's in the trunk.

874
00:38:14.248 --> 00:38:15.965
I could skip a round.

875
00:38:15.989 --> 00:38:17.445
Okay. well. don't miss.

876
00:38:17.469 --> 00:38:20.099
FBI! Drop your weapon!

877
00:38:22.604 --> 00:38:23.625
Go. Go. go.

878
00:38:23.649 --> 00:38:26.391
I got him.

879
00:38:30.699 --> 00:38:31.699
Hey. faith.

880
00:38:33.398 --> 00:38:34.679
You're okay.

881
00:38:34.703 --> 00:38:36.052
Hey.

882
00:38:37.880 --> 00:38:39.380
Where's Lucas?

883
00:38:39.404 --> 00:38:41.469
Where's my brother?

884
00:38:41.493 --> 00:38:42.687
I want my brother.

885
00:38:42.711 --> 00:38:44.080
We've got him. faith. He's safe.

886
00:38:44.104 --> 00:38:45.690
Come on.

887
00:38:45.714 --> 00:38:48.084
- Is he okay?
- He's okay.

888
00:39:01.556 --> 00:39:05.580
Such a tragedy. right?

889
00:39:05.604 --> 00:39:08.017
Kid just made one bad
choice after another.

890
00:39:08.041 --> 00:39:10.498
He was just trying to save his family.

891
00:39:10.522 --> 00:39:12.456
Dad is dead. He's going to prison.

892
00:39:12.480 --> 00:39:15.440
That girl is gonna end up in foster care.

893
00:39:15.570 --> 00:39:17.548
I wish this one had a happier ending.

894
00:39:17.572 --> 00:39:19.158
Yeah. me too.

895
00:39:19.182 --> 00:39:22.466
They are both still young.

896
00:39:22.490 --> 00:39:26.165
You know. with early parole

897
00:39:26.189 --> 00:39:29.299
and the right support
system. maybe it's not too late

898
00:39:29.323 --> 00:39:33.129
for Lucas to make different choices.

899
00:39:33.153 --> 00:39:34.957
I'd like to believe that.

900
00:39:34.981 --> 00:39:36.374
Yeah.

901
00:40:01.660 --> 00:40:04.987
Some things never change. jubal.

902
00:40:05.011 --> 00:40:07.598
I can hear you thinking from in here.

903
00:40:10.538 --> 00:40:13.038
I couldn't tell if you were awake.

904
00:40:13.062 --> 00:40:15.911
I am glad you're gonna be okay.

905
00:40:15.935 --> 00:40:19.567
It'll take more than
this to bring me down.

906
00:40:19.591 --> 00:40:22.787
Today was almost like the old days.

907
00:40:22.811 --> 00:40:24.876
That's your idea of a good time?

908
00:40:24.900 --> 00:40:27.662
Well. speaking of the old days.

909
00:40:27.686 --> 00:40:28.774
I brought you something.

910
00:40:31.820 --> 00:40:35.104
Remember our little
side business in Moscow?

911
00:40:35.128 --> 00:40:38.586
Stealing pastila from the school comms

912
00:40:38.610 --> 00:40:42.024
and selling it to the rich
kids at twice the price.

913
00:40:43.702 --> 00:40:44.809
It was a nice little scheme?

914
00:40:44.833 --> 00:40:45.878
Yeah.

915
00:40:46.008 --> 00:40:50.075
We were always a good team.

916
00:40:50.099 --> 00:40:51.623
Yeah. we were.

917
00:40:54.277 --> 00:40:57.474
How long are you gonna
be in New York for. you think?

918
00:40:57.498 --> 00:41:00.675
I'm sure someone in your
office can answer that for you.

919
00:41:05.375 --> 00:41:07.247
It's not too late.

920
00:41:09.554 --> 00:41:12.470
I know... I know it wouldn't be

921
00:41:12.600 --> 00:41:16.362
exactly how we planned. but...

922
00:41:16.386 --> 00:41:21.740
I could help you actually get out.

923
00:41:23.089 --> 00:41:26.179
You have to work with
me. We can make it happen.

924
00:41:27.441 --> 00:41:30.289
I know what you're saying.

925
00:41:30.313 --> 00:41:33.229
I. too. am happy to see you again. jubal.

926
00:41:33.360 --> 00:41:35.493
But...

927
00:41:40.236 --> 00:41:44.545
Next time we meet.

928
00:41:44.676 --> 00:41:48.070
I do not expect it will be as friends.

929
00:42:03.216 --> 00:42:05.411
Get well soon. andrei.

929
00:42:06.305 --> 00:43:06.532
